<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>لا يمكنك الدخول — FX9 Dashboard</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="denied-page">
    <div class="denied-box glass fade-in-up">
      <div class="denied-lock-icon">
        <i class="fas fa-lock"></i>
      </div>
      <h1>غير مصرح بالدخول</h1>
      <p class="denied-subtitle">هذه اللوحة خاصة بمالك البوت فقط</p>
      <div class="denied-features">
        <div class="denied-feature">
          <i class="fas fa-robot"></i>
          <span>لديك سيرفر وتريد استخدام البوت؟</span>
        </div>
        <div class="denied-feature">
          <i class="fas fa-plus-circle"></i>
          <span>أضف البوت إلى سيرفرك للبدء</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="denied-divider"></div>
      <div class="denied-actions">
        <a href="/maintenance" class="denied-btn denied-btn-primary">
          <i class="fas fa-screwdriver-wrench"></i>
          إضافة البوت
        </a>
        <a href="https://discord.gg/fx9" class="denied-btn denied-btn-secondary" target="_blank">
          <i class="fab fa-discord"></i>
          سيرفر الدعم
        </a>
        <a href="/auth/logout" class="denied-btn denied-btn-outline">
          <i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i>
          تسجيل الخروج
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="denied-footer">
        <p>FX9 Dashboard &copy; 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0f1a 0%, #1a1a2e 50%, #0f0f1a 100%);
      direction: rtl;
      font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
    }
    .denied-page {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 420px;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .denied-box {
      padding: 48px 32px 36px;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 20px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .denied-box::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -60px;
      left: -60px;
      width: 140px;
      height: 140px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(237,66,69,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .denied-box::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -80px;
      right: -80px;
      width: 200px;
      height: 200px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(237,66,69,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .denied-lock-icon {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(237,66,69,0.2), rgba(237,66,69,0.05));
      border: 2px solid rgba(237,66,69,0.3);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #ed4245;
      animation: deniedPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes deniedPulse {
      0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(237,66,69,0.3); }
      50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 12px rgba(237,66,69,0); }
    }
    .denied-box h1 {
      margin: 0 0 6px;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text, #eee);
    }
    .denied-subtitle {
      margin: 0 0 24px;
      color: var(--text-secondary, #999);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .denied-features {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .denied-feature {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary, #bbb);
      text-align: right;
    }
    .denied-feature i {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: rgba(88,101,242,0.15);
      color: #5865f2;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .denied-divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(to left, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.1), transparent);
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .denied-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .denied-btn {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 13px 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .denied-btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5865f2, #4752c4);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(88,101,242,0.3);
    }
    .denied-btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(88,101,242,0.4);
    }
    .denied-btn-secondary {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      color: var(--text, #ddd);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }
    .denied-btn-secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    }
    .denied-btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: #ed4245;
      border: 1px solid rgba(237,66,69,0.4);
    }
    .denied-btn-outline:hover {
      background: rgba(237,66,69,0.08);
      border-color: #ed4245;
    }
    .denied-footer {
      margin-top: 24px;
    }
    .denied-footer p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--text-muted, #555);
    }
    .fade-in-up {
      animation: deniedFadeInUp 0.6s ease forwards;
    }
    @keyframes deniedFadeInUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  </style>
</body>
</html>